# Terraform
# Provider binaries: ~705MB locally, and the AWS provider alone exceeds GitHub's
# 100MB per-file limit, so committing this directory hard-fails the push.
infra/terraform/.terraform/
# State records the full resource inventory and can carry resource attributes
# verbatim; it is regenerable from the cloud and does not belong in git.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan.out
